        <mxCell id="XSWVRQb09KiO38W7cZdC-57" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Properties and functionalities&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;- &lt;b&gt;selector&lt;/b&gt;(job): device suggestion if job has no preference&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Queue hierarchy between scheduler and submitter&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;+ sched_queue: general job queue&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;+ sub_queue: device-specific job queue&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- &lt;b&gt;schedule&lt;/b&gt;(job) governs the scheduling of tasks at the scheduler and submit sides. The scheduling scenarios and criteria are specified in the next section.&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="210" width="430" x="38.5" y="420" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="XSWVRQb09KiO38W7cZdC-58" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Context&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;- At &lt;b&gt;sched_queue&lt;/b&gt;:&amp;nbsp;Possible conditions (or params)&lt;b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;+ fair_share_score: between MQP and HPCQC jobs&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;+ priority_score&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;+ backfilling jobs at&amp;nbsp;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;sched_queue &lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;into&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt; sub_queue&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;(s)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;+ co-scheduling jobs between &lt;b&gt;sched_queue&lt;/b&gt; and &lt;b&gt;slurm_queue&lt;/b&gt; on HPC systems&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;- At &lt;b&gt;sub_queue&lt;/b&gt;:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Possible conditions (or params)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;+ limit queue size: because the available devices are limited&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;+ backfilling jobs with &lt;b&gt;sched_queue&lt;/b&gt; when one of the &lt;b&gt;sub_queue&lt;/b&gt;(s) is not full&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;+&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="330" width="476" x="514" y="420" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
